WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.218
A manager asks Daniel to approve a supplier exception

00:00:03.284 --> 00:00:07.942
because he has direct executive access Here a supplier

00:00:07.994 --> 00:00:10.652
exception means a request to depart from the normal

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:15.507
supplier process or requirements No approval authority for that

00:00:15.573 --> 00:00:19.336
departure has been delegated to Daniel How can he

00:00:19.349 --> 00:00:22.757
help the request reach the appointed approver without approving

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:23.613
it himself

